==English==

===Etymology===
{{bor+|en|rme}}, from {{der|en|rom|angar||coal}}, from {{der|en|sa|अङ्गार|tr=áṅgāra||charcoal, coal}}, from {{der|en|iir-pro|*Hángāras}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*h₁óngʷl̥}}. The English term {{m|en|coal}} was itself used as a slang term for money in England in the 18th and 19th century.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈwɒŋɡə/}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɒŋɡə|s=2}}

